  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "What is the correct ordering of the three numbers \\( \\frac{5}{19} ,\\) \\( \\frac{7}{21} ,\\) and \\( \\frac{9}{23} ,\\) in increasing order?",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\( \\dfrac{9}{23} \\lt \\dfrac{7}{21} \\lt \\dfrac{5}{19}\\)"
    },
    {
